     A**
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PMG01                     TEXT('BILL ENTRY MESSAGE FILE')
     A            MGCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            MGSUB#    R               REFFLD(SUB#)
     A            MGFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            MGFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            MGCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            MGDCS#    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('FADCP Xref#')
     A            MGDSEQ    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('Detail Charge Seq#')
     A            MGMSEQ    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('Message Seq#')
     A            MGEOB#    R               REFFLD(EOB#)
     A            MGMSG#    R               REFFLD(MSG#)
     A                                      COLHDG('MESSAGE ID')
     A            MGMSFX    R               REFFLD(DS12)
     A                                      COLHDG('MESSAGE SUFFIX')
     A            MGCSI     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('MESSAGE STATUS')
     A*                      Note: Status codes based on HPR format:
     A*                            A = Accepted     D = Denied
     A*                            E = Error        Q = Question
     A*                            R = Replaced     S = Supersede
     A*
     A            MGSRC     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Source of Error')
     A*                      Note: Valid values are contained in the
     A*                            generic table (FTGTP) under the
     A*                            'ERMG' ID entry.
     A*
     A            MGSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            MGUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT USER')
     A            MGPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT PROGRAM')
     A            MGTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT TIME')
     A            MGDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT DATE')
     A            MGIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL USER')
     A            MGIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL PROGRAM')
     A            MGITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL TIME')
     A            MGIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL DATE')
     A*** BEG ADD *** 11/19/98 ****************************************
     A            MGRCN     R               REFFLD(RCN)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECON NUMBER')
     A*** END ADD *** 11/19/98 ****************************************
     A*** BEG ADD *** 11/30/00 ****************************************
     A            MGDESC    R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('ERROR MSG' 'DESC')
     A*** END ADD *** 11/30/00 ****************************************
